# ── TA secrets and machine-local state under .ta/ (never commit) ─────────────
# Keys, bearer tokens and credential stores. A root signing key was found
# untracked and unignored in the project tree (red-team finding CR-03);
# these rules keep it from being committed by `git add -A`. The planned fix
# (PLAN v0.17.12.1) moves these out of the project tree entirely.
.ta/*.key
.ta/*.pem
.ta/broker_root.key
.ta/audit.key
.ta/credentials.key
.ta/credentials.json
.ta/daemon-tokens.json
.ta/tokens/
.ta/team-sessions/
.ta/whiteboard-session.json
.ta/nats-jetstream/
.ta/nats-server.log
.ta/nats-server.pid
.ta/wake-attempts/
.ta/wake-dead-letter.jsonl
.ta/daemon.pid
.ta/daemon.log
.ta/mcp-agent.json
.ta/mcp-agent-chat.json
